(
    title: "Black Bass: Lure Fishing",
    developer: Some("Hot-B"),
    description: Some("A bass-fishing tournament against 99 other anglers across twelve fishing days on two lakes, climbing three classes by raising your average bass weight. You move the boat to a spot, pick a lure and colour, cast with a timed power bar, then work the lure in an underwater 3-D view and reel or brake against the line-stress meter when a fish strikes. Passwords save your standing."),
